ott</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name><name><surname>Gimeno</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Mahon</surname><given-names>NG</given-names></name><name><surname>Poloniecki</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>McKenna</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relation between severity of left-ventricular hypertrophy and prognosis in patients with hypertrophic cardiomyopathy</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2001</year><volume>357</volume><fpage>420</fpage><lpage>424</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11273061</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(00)04005-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maron</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Shen</surname><given-names>W-K</given-names></name><name><surname>Link</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Epstein</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><name><surname>Almquist</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Daubert</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Bardy</surname><given-names>GH</given-names></name><name><surname>Favale</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Rea</surname><given-names>RF</given-names></name><name><surname>Boriani</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Estes</surname><given-names>NA</given-names><suffix>3rd</suffix></name><name><surname>Spirito</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Efficacy of implantable cardioverter-defibrillators for the prevention of sudden death in patients with hypertrophic cardiomyopathy</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>342</volume><fpage>365</fpage><lpage>373</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10666426</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1056/NEJM200002103420601</pub-id></cit